WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.069 --> 00:00:03.119
So in summary I am on top of things and

00:00:03.119 --> 00:00:03.640
(crash)

00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:05.080
(scream)

00:00:07.260 --> 00:00:08.300
(scream)

00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:11.020
(baby crying)

00:00:11.020 --> 00:00:11.980
Ok, I'm out

00:00:12.340 --> 00:00:13.560
(scream)

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.700
And let that teach you a valuable lesson

00:00:17.560 --> 00:00:18.880
What lesson?!

00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:19.620
(baby crying)

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:22.620
I will get back to you when I figure that out

00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:24.440
Come on

00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:33.820
It's headed for the break room!

00:00:33.940 --> 00:00:35.220
Stuart, get sugared up!

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:39.420
(screaming)

00:00:40.360 --> 00:00:42.040
So, he gets cookies??

00:00:56.700 --> 00:00:59.600
Looks like you're not done here after all, Templeton.

00:00:59.600 --> 00:01:02.040
I'll take Stacy and deal with the Jimbo situation

00:01:02.480 --> 00:01:03.820
That one's on you

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:05.220
Ummm

00:01:05.220 --> 00:01:07.740
Is there like a security guard, or...?

00:01:08.140 --> 00:01:08.680
Triplets!

00:01:11.240 --> 00:01:11.960
Yes, boss?

00:01:11.960 --> 00:01:13.120
Reporting for duty!

00:01:13.120 --> 00:01:14.200
Hi, boss' brother!

00:01:14.200 --> 00:01:17.140
Call me when you've got him contained. Don't get me fired!

00:01:18.460 --> 00:01:23.460
I'm a security! (ambulance sounds)

00:01:25.540 --> 00:01:26.700
Goo-goo, ga-ga?

00:01:27.580 --> 00:01:32.420
So, is the giant muscle baby working with the killer robot swing, or?

00:01:32.420 --> 00:01:34.920
Who cares! Get in there and find my little boy!

00:01:36.920 --> 00:01:38.500
What did you do?

00:01:38.980 --> 00:01:42.160
Whaaaaa?

00:01:43.440 --> 00:01:44.080
Scooter!

00:01:56.080 --> 00:01:58.460
Hey, everything's under control here

00:01:58.700 --> 00:02:03.120
You're an atrocious liar, but that's not what I'm calling about. The Busky house is surrounded!

00:02:03.120 --> 00:02:04.960
We had to send out the baby swing as a distraction

00:02:05.700 --> 00:02:06.820
It's got my gun!

00:02:07.900 --> 00:02:10.960
I need you to scan the big board and find us an escape route

00:02:10.960 --> 00:02:14.000
Tick tock, Templeton, this situation is at crisis levels here!

00:02:14.520 --> 00:02:15.600
Stacy, how's the neighborhood?

00:02:15.600 --> 00:02:18.080
People are really hating baby, sir!

00:02:18.240 --> 00:02:19.880
Okay, I have an idea!

00:02:19.880 --> 00:02:21.860
And I have a crisis. Winner? Me.

00:02:21.860 --> 00:02:22.880
Where's my escape route?

00:02:22.920 --> 00:02:24.860
Oh, Scooter!

00:02:26.620 --> 00:02:28.620
I found more cookies and juice boxes!

00:02:29.860 --> 00:02:30.910
Templeton!

00:02:30.910 --> 00:02:33.900
Templeton where are you? I've lost contact.

00:02:33.900 --> 00:02:34.600
Block the door

00:02:37.080 --> 00:02:38.140
Nooo!

00:02:38.140 --> 00:02:40.500
They can't send me back to day care

00:02:45.960 --> 00:02:47.140
Oh, thank goodness.

00:02:47.440 --> 00:02:48.660
Exit route, Templeton, ASAP

00:02:48.660 --> 00:02:52.900
Or, since I got Scooter, I could just send him back to his parents

00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:53.900
Oh, what!

00:02:53.940 --> 00:02:56.440
The situation is a powder keg and that baby is the blowtorch!

00:02:56.440 --> 00:02:59.640
You send him out now and no one in this neighborhood will ever love babies again!

00:02:59.640 --> 00:03:03.220
I absolutely forbid! wait. Where are you right now?

00:03:03.220 --> 00:03:04.220
Too late!

00:03:20.380 --> 00:03:22.640
Templeton, you've doomed us all

00:03:33.240 --> 00:03:34.160
Scooter?

00:03:38.120 --> 00:03:38.760
Baby boy!

00:03:39.880 --> 00:03:40.680
(laughter)

00:03:46.240 --> 00:03:48.220
We are back to work, Templeton

00:03:48.220 --> 00:03:49.980
Hello, you beautiful baby corp!

00:03:49.980 --> 00:03:50.840
Yes, boss?

00:03:50.840 --> 00:03:51.800
Reporting for duty!

00:03:51.800 --> 00:03:52.960
Hi, boss' brother!

00:03:52.960 --> 00:03:54.700
Are they always this friendly?

00:03:56.640 --> 00:03:59.500
I can't have my own brother ignorant to the art of business. It's embarrassing

00:03:59.500 --> 00:04:03.820
I make sure the world loves babies more than puppies, more than kittens

00:04:05.800 --> 00:04:07.080
What's the threat

00:04:07.080 --> 00:04:07.860
A cat!

00:04:07.860 --> 00:04:08.820
What?!

00:04:08.820 --> 00:04:09.800
Cats don't play by rules

00:04:13.600 --> 00:04:14.740
What's up?

00:04:14.740 --> 00:04:16.640
This meeting is making me uncomfortable

00:04:17.080 --> 00:04:17.980
What do we do?

00:04:21.020 --> 00:04:22.480
I'm gonna bag the tiger

00:04:25.920 --> 00:04:27.720
Are you and your brother having fun?

00:04:29.160 --> 00:04:30.900
Nothing suspicious, I love you, bye!

00:04:31.160 --> 00:04:32.040
This is my job on the line

00:04:33.300 --> 00:04:36.700
You made a choice to join a family. We can fix this!

00:04:37.060 --> 00:04:39.200
What if you broke stuff and blamed it on the cat?

00:04:39.200 --> 00:04:41.120
Yes! Gold star for Stacey!

00:04:41.120 --> 00:04:43.320
In fairness, sir, the cat thought of it first

00:04:48.040 --> 00:04:50.180
You can't kill what you can't see

00:04:50.180 --> 00:04:51.780
Time to go invisible!

00:04:53.240 --> 00:04:54.680
Mommy is a dirty liar!

